| Instance Name | Resource | Clock Region | Clock Source | Reference Clock | Feedback Mode | Feedback Clock |  Clkout0   |  Clkout1  | Clkout2 |
+---------------+----------+--------------+--------------+-----------------+---------------+----------------+------------+-----------+---------+
|   pll_inst1   | PLL_TL0  |              |   external   |    CLK_48Mhz    |    internal   |                | pll_150Mhz | pll_24Mhz |         |
+---------------+----------+--------------+--------------+-----------------+---------------+----------------+------------+-----------+---------+

Instance Name                 : pll_inst1
Resource                      : PLL_TL0
Reset Pin Name                : pll_reset
Locked Pin Name               : pll_lock
Clock Source                  : external
Reference Clock Resource      : GPIOL_74
Reference Clock               : CLK_48Mhz
Feedback Mode                 : internal

Reference Clock Frequency     : 48.0000 MHz
Reference Clock Period        : 20.8333 ns
Multiplier (M)                : 50
Pre-Divider (N)               : 2
VCO Frequency                 : 1200.0000 MHz
Post-Divider (O)              : 2
PLL Frequency                 : 600.0000 MHz

Output Clock 0
Clock Pin Name                : pll_150Mhz
Output Divider                : 4
Output Phase Shift            : 0
Output Frequency              : 150.0000 MHz
Output Period                 : 6.667 ns

Output Clock 1
Clock Pin Name                : pll_24Mhz
Output Divider                : 25
Output Phase Shift            : 0
Output Frequency              : 24.0000 MHz
Output Period                 : 41.667 ns

Frequency calculations:
	VCO = REFCLK * (M/N)
	    = 48.0000 MHz * (50/2)
	    = 1200.0000 MHz
	PLL = VCO / O
	    = 1200.0000 MHz / 2
	    = 600.0000 MHz

	CLKOUT0 = PLL / CLKOUT0_DIV
	        = 600.0000 MHz / 4
	        = 150.0000 MHz
	CLKOUT1 = PLL / CLKOUT1_DIV
	        = 600.0000 MHz / 25
	        = 24.0000 MHz

SDC Constraints:
	create_clock -period 6.667 -name pll_150Mhz [get_ports {pll_150Mhz}]
	create_clock -period 41.667 -name pll_24Mhz [get_ports {pll_24Mhz}]

